{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:4afad1897ececcf2","name":"Remote Limb Control","source":{"id":"source:reference-4afad1897ececcf2","title":"Remote Limb Control","revision":21091,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T01:08:53Z","sha256":"bd984e327aa85da30eff1feb137627db0ad92c2993b7daec38d3057cdefd4017","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21091","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Remote%20Limb%20Control&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-4afad1897ececcf2","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scavenger's Guide to Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scavenger%27s_Guide_to_Droids"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," Appendage Cost x 2\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Restricted"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Restricted"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A disassembled ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," is usually not a threat. Most beings overlook a pile of Droid parts on the floor and keep moving. This package allows a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," to voluntarily remove an arm or a hand and operate it as if it were still attached to the Droid's body.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["This equipment comes in basic and deluxe versions. The 1,500-credit basic package enables one specified Appendage to operate on its own. The Appendage has a small repulsor unit inside it, allowing it to move (",{"tag":"a","children":["Hovering"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hovering","referenceId":"reference:ae139bb21e607feb"},") up to 6 squares, and remains functional at a maximum range of 24 squares. While detached, the Appendage can perform any action it would normally be able to if attached to the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"},". The 6,000-credit deluxe package enables multiple limbs to be active at once. A ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," can control a number of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Appendages"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Appendages"}," equal to 1 + its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Intelligence"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Intelligence"}," modifier (minimum 1).\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
